,编程,计算机,教育,C++Builder6,C++Builder,BCB,VCL,Delphi","description":"http://www.qinglongweb.com/biancheng/362.html\n为数不多的C++Builder视频，虽然是C++Builder3的视频，总算聊胜于无吧。希望能帮到大家，让大家自学轻松一点。觉得不错别忘了给我投个币哦~"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1Ze411c7bV","aid":264176806,"title":"【赛题讲解】abc282 C - String Delimiter","author":"今天你学废了么","mid":3461575069403560,"duration":"2:37","pic":"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8ff99f8bf7a1873925b2a8076ff1343905ffeddb.jpg","play":1136,"video_review":0,"pubdate":1671954664,"tag":"课程,我们都爱搞学习,C - String Delimiter,学习,经验分享,语法入门,赛题讲解,我们都爱搞学习·第四期,讲解,abc282","description":""},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1cD4y1R7f9","aid":712682273,"title":"122101","author":"-人间值得啊-","mid":345135269,"duration":"216:5","pic":"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d17cf09a25081b1b42148ff3fa31e268dc149fd8.jpg","play":16100,"video_review":1,"pubdate":1604481995,"tag":"学习","description":""},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1Ae4y1t7AJ","aid":647163918,"title":"[C++ STL] C++17知识点 比union更简单 实用的可变体 std::variant","author":"账号已注销","mid":172172152,"duration":"7:5","pic":"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ead79819b44c65a6492b29f2cd58f8e6e6ba8218.jpg","play":4196,"video_review":1,"pubdate":1667403382,"tag":"union,C++入门,联合体,STL,C/C++,bilibili实用UP主扶持计划,variant,编程语言","description":"std::variant是类型安全的union类型，与union类似，std::variant的一个实例要么存储了可选类型中的一个值，要么没有存储。但与union比，其优势是可以判断当前真实的存储类型并且可以存储类这种复杂的数据结构。当然C++11中的union也可以存储复杂的类型，但是没有variant简单。\n\n示例：https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0HicCoIpYSaPtV5dQBloog\n交流： 658123957"},{"type":"video","bvid":"BV1XNd3YeEh5","aid":114312450411013,"title":"c0c635b646735a0fee440368f3c596c3_raw","author":"南方农村报","mid":2070726228,"duration":"3:8","pic":"//i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7075d7747ba5c2fe9645c9eba85807e871cded53.jpg","play":46,"video_review":0,"pubdate":1744270027,"tag":"记录,学习,生活记录","description":""}]}}